WEBVTT

00:01:58.755 --> 00:02:02.981
and greeted me with this blank expression.

00:02:02.981 --> 00:02:05.859
The prison warden, looking equally indifferent,

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:08.506
said, "Any trouble, just press the red buzzer,

00:02:08.506 --> 00:02:10.945
and we'll be around as soon as we can."

00:02:10.945 --> 00:02:13.903
(Laughter)

00:02:13.903 --> 00:02:15.673
I sat down.

00:02:15.673 --> 00:02:18.650
The heavy metal door slammed shut behind me.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.744
I looked up at the red buzzer

00:02:20.744 --> 00:02:22.843
far behind Joe on the opposite wall.

00:02:22.843 --> 00:02:25.489
(Laughter)

00:02:25.489 --> 00:02:27.251
I looked at Joe.

00:02:27.251 --> 00:02:29.328
Perhaps detecting my concern,

00:02:29.328 --> 00:02:30.684
he leaned forward, and said,